EXACT SUPPORT MASS FOR {a,2a,b} (codex-S59)
d=gcd(a,b), A=a/d, B=b/d, gcd(A,B)=1
M({a,2a,b}) = C[A mod 14][B mod 28] / (686*A*B)
C=0 iff 7|A or 14|B
sign(C)=centered_sign_14(A)*centered_sign_28(B) away from zero

